stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Order lifecycle
  accDescr: How an order moves from placed to closed
  state if_state <<choice>>
  state fork_state <<fork>>
  state join_state <<join>>
  state OldStyle <<choice>>
  State1 : The state with a note
  state "This is a state description" as s2
  s3 : first line
  s3 : second line
  state "Alias" as s4
  s4 : with a description
  [*] --> IsPositive
  IsPositive --> if_state
  if_state --> False : if n < 0
  if_state --> True : if n >= 0
  [*] --> fork_state
  fork_state --> State2
  fork_state --> State3
  State2 --> join_state
  State3 --> join_state
  join_state --> State4
  State4 --> [*]
  State1 --> State2
  note right of State1
    Important information! You can write
    notes: even with a colon.
  end note
  note left of State2 : This is the note to the left.
